{"id":"5653","groups":[{"type":"pnri","label":"相关图像","images":[{"src":"/images/compressed/5653_main_altocumulus-stratiformis-opacus-undulatus_clouds.jpg","title":"","description":"<div class=\"img_desc\" id=\"desc1\"><p>天空似乎笼罩着一层高积云，显示是成层云种。云层大部分很厚，完全遮蔽太阳（蔽光云类）。图片上方清晰可见的<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">云素</span>已合并为<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">大致平行排列成行的云</span>（波状云类），在云层中横跨所观测到的风向。</p>\n<p>不可将此云误认为是高层云，其特点在于外观均匀且基本无特征。</p>\n</div>","copyright":"© Markéta Augustinová","location":"捷克，捷克布杰约维采","latitude":"纬度: 48° 57' 8'' N","longitude":"经度: 14° 28' 15'' E","date":"15 September 2015 0615 (当地时间)","direction":"摄像机方向：朝向南东南","cloudCode":"CL= 0, CM= 7, CH= /","code":"图像P/S代码: P.4.9","imageId":"图像P/S代码: P.4.9"},{"src":"/images/original/syn/5653_syn_altocumulus-stratiformis-opacus-undulatus_clouds.gif","title":"","description":"<div class=\"img_desc\" id=\"desc2\"><p>弱冷锋过境捷克，且锢囚锋正向东超过该地区。</p>\n</div>","copyright":"© 皇家版权","location":"","latitude":"","longitude":"","date":"","direction":"","cloudCode":"","code":"","imageId":""},{"src":"/images/original/upper/5653_upper_altocumulus-stratiformis-opacus-undulatus_clouds.gif","title":"","description":"<div class=\"img_desc\" id=\"desc3\"><p>5小时前向北115公里进行的探测显示出3500-4800米的饱和层。</p>\n</div>","copyright":"© 怀俄明大学","location":"","latitude":"","longitude":"","date":"","direction":"","cloudCode":"","code":"","imageId":""},{"src":"/images/compressed/sat/5653_sat_altocumulus-stratiformis-opacus-undulatus_clouds.jpg","title":"","description":"<div class=\"img_desc\" id=\"desc4\"><p>捷克上空覆盖着一层大范围的中层云。</p>\n</div>","copyright":"© EUMETSAT, 2014","location":"","latitude":"","longitude":"","date":"","direction":"","cloudCode":"","code":"","imageId":""}]},{"type":"pri","label":"1987年版图像","images":[{"src":"/images/compressed/4464_main_altocumulus-stratiformis-opacus_clouds.jpg","title":"","description":"<div class=\"img_desc\" id=\"desc5\"><p>掠射照明使得覆盖照片右半部分的蔽光高积云云层的起伏显得尤为明显，尤其在靠近地平线处，可以看到<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">1</span>和<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">2</span>位置的波纹与波状结构。在较低高度，<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">于3处</span>，观测到一片层积云，它显然是由白天发展起来、但在傍晚消退的对流云形成。一道准静止锋伴随着高层云-雨层云系统，呈西北偏北—东南偏南走向，正位于瑞典上空。该观测站恰好处于逐渐退去的云系西缘，在观测地点该云系已演变为高积云。</p></div>","copyright":"© T. Bergeron","location":"Rundhögen, Sweden","latitude":"纬度: 63° 15' 0'' N","longitude":"经度: 12° 11' 20'' E","date":"10 July 1945 2130 (当地时间)","direction":"摄像机方向：朝向北西北","cloudCode":"CL= 4, CM= 7, CH= 0","code":"","imageId":""}]}]}